  "description": "CR 702.182a, 205.1b, 603.2, 121.1, 121.2: Astrologian's Planisphere makes its Hero a Wizard that gets a +1/+1 counter when you cast a noncreature spell and when you draw your third card each turn",
  "note": "Job select (CR 702.182a) makes and equips the Hero, a Wizard in addition (CR 205.1b). Three Elvish Visionaries are creature spells, so their casts add nothing; their draws are alice's first, second and third this turn, and only the third adds a counter (CR 121.2). Divination is a noncreature spell: its cast adds the second counter while it is still on the stack, and its draws, alice's fourth and fifth, add none. On bob's turn bob's Divination is an opponent's noncreature spell and gives bob his third draw of the turn (draw step plus two): neither adds a counter.",
